    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE AL MANAR COLLEGE",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      228.05,
      401.89,
      288.95
    ],
    "text": "WHERE a college called and known as the \u201cAl Manar College\u201dhas heretofore been establish by the New Kaththankudy - 03,for the purpose of effectually carrying out and transacting allobjects and matters connected with the said College accordingto the rules agreed to by its members:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      302.45,
      401.88,
      363.35
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the said College has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the objects andmatters for which it was formed and has applied to beincorporated and it will be for the advantage to grant suchapplication:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      376.85,
      401.89,
      400.55
    ],
    "text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      413.93,
      401.74,
      437.75
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Al Manar College(Incorporation) Act, No. 2015.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      451.13,
      401.93,
      561.71
    ],
    "text": "2.From and after the date of commencement of thisAct, such and so many persons as now are members of the\u201cAl Manar College\u201d (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cCollege\u201d)or shall hereafter be admitted as members shall be a bodycorporate (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cCorporation\u201d)with perpetual succession under the name and style of\u201cAl Manar College\u201d and by that name may sue and be suedin all courts, with full power and authority to have and use acommon seal and alter the same at its pleasure.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      575.21,
      401.87,
      598.91
    ],
    "text": "3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      612.41,
      401.89,
      636.11
    ],
    "text": "(a)catering to the needs of religious education of thestate School children;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      649.61,
      401.88,
      673.31
    ],
    "text": "(b)giving special training in selected IslamicReligious fields on the basis of student\u2019s choice;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
